ecome a vendor at our events and connect with hundreds of passionate collectors.</p></div><div class=\"vendor-apply-layout\"><div class=\"vendor-apply-form-wrapper\"><form class=\"vendor-apply-form\" action=\"\" encType=\"multipart/form-data\" method=\"POST\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"$ACTION_REF_1\"/><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"$ACTION_1:0\" value=\"{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;601ab9c2e4833133e98bc54be27ed8903ace03a942&quot;,&quot;bound&quot;:&quot;$@1&quot;}\"/><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"$ACTION_1:1\" value=\"[{&quot;message&quot;:&quot;&quot;}]\"/><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"$ACTION_KEY\" value=\"kdf7a09baceb62cf92e86695fae81a109\"/><div class=\"vendor-form-section\"><h3 class=\"vendor-form-section-title\">Business Information</h3><div class=\"vendor-form-grid\"><div class=\"vendor-form-group\"><label for=\"business_name\">Business Name *</label><input id=\"business_name\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g. Rare Card Co.\" required=\"\" name=\"business_name\" value=\"\"/></div><div class=\"vendor-form-group\"><label for=\"logo\">Business Logo / Avatar *</label><label for=\"logo\" class=\"upload-zone \" style=\"cursor:pointer;display:block\"><input id=\"logo\" type=\"file\" accept=\"image/*\" required=\"\" class=\"sr-only\" name=\"logo\"/><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem\"><div style=\"width:64px;height:64px;background:var(--color-yellow);border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:3px solid var(--color-dark)\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"color:var(--color-dark)\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"17 8 12 3 7 8\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"15\"></line></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:1rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--color-dark);text-transform:uppercase\">Click to upload logo</span><span style=\"font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:500;color:#666\">Maximum file size: 5MB (PNG, JPG)</span></div></label></div><div class=\"vendor-form-group\"><label for=\"contact_name\">Contact Name *</label><input id=\"contact_name\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Your full name\" required=\"\" name=\"contact_name\" value=\"\"/></div><div class=\"vendor-form-group\"><label for=\"email\">Email Address *</label><input id=\"email\" type=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" required=\"\" name=\"email\" value=\"\"/></div><div class=\"vendor-form-group\"><label for=\"phone\">Phone Number</label><input id=\"phone\" type=\"tel\" placeholder=\"+61 400 000 000\" name=\"phone\" value=\"\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"vendor-form-section\"><h3 class=\"vendor-form-section-title\">What do you sell? *</h3><p class=\"vendor-form-section-hint\">Select all categories that apply.</p><div class=\"vendor-category-grid\"><label class=\"vendor-category-chip \"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"sr-only\" name=\"categories\" value=\"Pokémon TCG\"/><span class=\"vendor-chip-check\">+</span>Pokémon TCG</label><label class=\"vendor-category-chip \"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"sr-only\" name=\"categories\" value=\"Yu-Gi-Oh!\"/><span class=\"vendor-chip-check\">+</span>Yu-Gi-Oh!</label><label class=\"vendor-category-chip \"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"sr-only\" name=\"categories\" value=\"Magic: The Gathering\"/><span class=\"vendor-chip-check\">+</span>Magic: The Gathering</label><label class=\"vendor-category-chip \"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"sr-only\" name=\"categories\" value=\"One Piece TCG\"/><span class=\"vendor-chip-check\">+</span>One Piece TCG</label><label class=\"vendor-category-chip \"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"sr-only\" name=\"categories\" value=\"Dragon Ball Super\"/><span class=\"vendor-chip-check\">+</span>Dragon Ball Super</label><label class=\"vendor-category-chip \"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"sr-only\" name=\"categories\" value=\"Sports Cards\"/><span class=\"vendor-chip-check\">+</span>Sports Cards</label><label class=\"vendor-category-chip \"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"sr-only\" name=\"categories\" value=\"Vintage / Retro Cards\"/><span class=\"vendor-chip-check\">+</span>Vintage / Retro Cards</label><label class=\"vendor-category-chip \"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"sr-only\" name=\"categories\" value=\"Card Accessories &amp; Supplies\"/><span class=\"vendor-chip-check\">+</span>Card Accessories &amp; Supplies</label><label class=\"vendor-category-chip \"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"sr-only\" name=\"categories\" value=\"Graded Cards\"/><span class=\"vendor-chip-check\">+</span>Graded Cards</label><label class=\"vendor-category-chip \"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"sr-only\" name=\"categories\" value=\"Other Collectibles\"/><span class=\"vendor-chip-check\">+</span>Other Collectibles</label></div></div><div class=\"vendor-form-section\"><h3 class=\"vendor-form-section-title\">About Your Business *</h3><div class=\"vendor-form-group vendor-form-group-wide\"><label for=\"description\">Tell us about your products, experience, and what you&#x27;d bring to the event.</label><textarea id=\"description\" name=\"description\" rows=\"5\" placeholder=\"We specialize in graded vintage Pokémon cards and sealed booster boxes. We&#x27;ve been selling at collector events for 3 years...\" required=\"\"></textarea></div></div><div class=\"vendor-form-section\"><h3 class=\"vendor-form-section-title\">Social Media &amp; Online Presence</h3><div class=\"vendor-form-grid\"><div class=\"vendor-form-group vendor-form-group-wide\"><label for=\"social_links\">Instagram / Social Links *</label><input id=\"social_links\" type=\"url\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"https://instagram.com/yourbusiness\" name=\"social_links\" value=\"\"/><span class=\"vendor-form-hint\">Share your Instagram, Facebook, or other social profiles.</span></div></div></div><div class=\"vendor-form-section\"><h3 class=\"vendor-form-section-title\">Event Requirements</h3><div class=\"vendor-form-grid\"><div class=\"vendor-form-group\"><label for=\"tables_requested\">Number of Tables Requested *</label><select id=\"tables_requested\" name=\"tables_requested\" required=\"\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Select quantity</option><option value=\"1\">1 Table</option><option value=\"2\">2 Tables</option><option value=\"3\">3 Tables</option><option value=\"4\">4 Tables</option><option value=\"5+\">5+ Tables (contact for large setup)</option></select></div><div class=\"vendor-form-group\"><label for=\"power_requirements\">Power Requirements</label><select id=\"power_requirements\" name=\"power_requirements\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Select requirement</option><option value=\"none\">No power needed</option><option value=\"standard\">Standard outlet (1-2 devices)</option><option value=\"multiple\">Multiple outlets (3+ devices)</option><option value=\"heavy\">Heavy duty (equipment requiring dedicated circuit)</option></select><span class=\"vendor-form-hint\">Let us know your electrical needs for the event.</span></div></div></div><div class=\"vendor-form-section\"><h3 class=\"vendor-form-section-title\">Additional Notes</h3><div class=\"vendor-form-group vendor-form-group-wide\"><label for=\"additional_notes\">Anything else we should know?</label><textarea id=\"additional_notes\" name=\"additional_notes\" rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"Special setup requirements, accessibility needs, or other information...\"></textarea></div></div><div class=\"vendor-form-section\"><div class=\"vendor-form-group vendor-form-group-wide\"><label class=\"vendor-agreement-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" required=\"\" name=\"agreement\"/><span>I agree to the <a href=\"/terms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Terms and Conditions</a> and confirm that all information provided is accurate. I understand that submission of this application does not guarantee vendor acceptance. *</span></label></div></div><button